CASH = cash paid at completion (equity + £20k deal costs + 10% of EV working capital). PG = personal guarantee on the bank loan (35% of facility typical).
Floor rule: cash above floor must cover CASH, and risk pot must cover PG x 0.35. With floor £60k and ~£160k start + 2 years of 3-day contracting, cash above floor at 2029 ≈ £150-200k in the median path.
